<title>UK: East Midlands Elec postpones H1 results.</title>
<headline>East Midlands Elec postpones H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British regional electricity company East Midlands Electricity Plc said on Tuesday that it was postponing its half-year results until after a government ruling on its takeover by Dominion Resources Inc.  </p>
<p>East Midlands had been due to release half-year results on December 16.</p>
<p>But the power supplier said in a statement that it would wait for a decision by the Department of Trade and Industry about whether to approve the agreed $2.15 billion acquisition by Dominion.</p>
<p>Three American utilities have so far been allowed to buy English regional electricity companies.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4020</p>
</text>
